<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- BUU</book>
  <para style="h">JAS - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc1">JAS - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc2">JAS - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc3">JAS - BUU</para>
  <para style="mt1">JAS - BUU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Ame Yakubu, nji ri ndu Izhi nga riwa Yeso Kristo, hi ri gɨzhi wuru don hari riwa wa shan ri mgbumgblu me, me chi yi kigbu:<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itsra Ngha Timbiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Biyi miri vayi won, i bi to wa tsra kankankan wa fe yi bi ka kɨma-u ti kya ri kinklan sron, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />ritu bi to itsra kpanyɨme mbi no yi vu sron. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Ivu sron ka tindu wan, ritu no yi he ri gbengbren bi ri he nji wan riwa a ti yi, bi ran kunyiren ran. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Inde iyo sron njo rimi mbi kunyiren ri wiwiri, no bre Izhi, riwa ari no ko ngaa bran, a ran ri wyen ran, nga wa ka no. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Ama tse a ibre ri sron riri a ran ri sron hari ran, nji riwa ari ibre ri sron hari, a he ka ishi ima ri nne, riwa gungu ri ran no gmo ran shi. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />No bibi nji mba no ran yo sron ri wawu ri fe kyari ri wo Bachi ran; <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />a he nji ri sron hari, a ran ri kri ri bubu riri ri kya riwa ari ti ran.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Wa hu Izhi wawa wa ran he ri kyari ran wa ngɨri inde Izhi dzon wa rimi Yuu. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Ama wa hu Izhi wawa wa he ri wo no wa yi yamba inde Izhi ngɨzhi wa ye mme, ritu gungu ri vu wa wo bibi riwa ari fu kɨbu konkron rega ri ji. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Inde iji zhuu ri gbaji wan ka giga ka kuu, ikɨbu wan ka kpo, bi wan ka time. Nghamba nye, nji ri woo ri dzi rega ri kya riwa ari ti.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Dindi ti ri he nji riwa a vu sron rimi tsra, ritu inde a vu sron rimi tsra-a, ari kpande, wato ika tre dzi riwa Izhi kadzi ri wawa wa nyɨme-u. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Inde itsra ye, njo ka ran tre ri, &lt;&lt;Izhi ri tsra wen ran.&gt;&gt; Ritu wana ri tsra Izhi ri meme ti ran, wawu rituwan ran ri tsra njo ran; <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />ama ko ngaa ri fe tsra, ritu mbye ri sron wan, riwa ari gyuru wu. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Meme mbye riwa inde a he nne, ari ngɨzhi meme ti, meme ti inde a gbron, ari ngɨzhi kuu ye. <verse eid="JAS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Ran no njo no gyuru yi ran, biyi wa miri vayi won wawa me nyɨme yi. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Ko bibi de riwa ri huiri bibi tan, wa zhuu ri shu nye, wa gɨzhi nye ri A ti kpan ri shu; riwa wa ran ri sran-u ran bibi wan riwu ran ko fiwen. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Ri bibi tre ri nne wan a ngɨzhi ta ye rimi kpunji tre, ritu no ta ki he bibi ngɨzhi ri gbuchi rimi ngɨzhi wan.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwo Tre ri Kpa Tindu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Imiri vayi won riwa me kpa nyɨme riyi, to rinyi yi, ko ngaa no srenton gbagbla ama ran ti rererimi tre nga rererimi fu, <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />ritu ifu nji ran ri ngɨzhi dindi ti ye ran. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Ritu ngamba, ka bibi ndu riwa ari kpa bubu dzu, nga meme ti bi ri kpa tre riwa wa sen-u ri sron mbi ri yo tu ri meme, ritu wawu nye ri kpayi chuwo. <verse eid="JAS 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Ama ran he wa wo tre kuklu ran, ama he wawa wa tindu ri wu, ran gyuru ngambi ran. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Inji riwa a wo tre ran ran tindu ri wu ran, a he ka nji riwa aya ngawan ri yu ri ya si <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />nga, ritu ari ya si wan nye ran hi ngawan, a ran ri taka bibi riwa wawu he ran. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Ama nji riwa ari milan ya hure ri kya riwa doka riwa ari kpanji chuwo, nji riwa a ka sron yo riwu, ran wo, ran ran kpa wurusi rega riwu ran, ama a tindu riwu, Izhi ri yo wo wan ri dindi riwu ritu kya riwa a ti. <verse eid="JAS 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Inde njo ri ya ri wawu he nji ri hu Izhi, ran ran vu nyu wan ran, a gyuru ngawan, ritu Izhi wan he kuklu nye. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Ikya riwa Izhi la ta ri ki ti a he ri ki milan mba wa kɨbo nga wawa wa ti mba wa kuu nga wari ri to ya ki ngɨzhi, ritu riwa ari zhuu riwa meme ti riwa mgbumgblu me ri yo wa rimi wan.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Itre Ritu Son Kankankan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Imiri vayi won rimi nkpen Bachi Yeso Kristo, ran ya njo tinkan ran, biyi wawa bi hu Izhi. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />No wa tre ri njo ye ri bubu kabrutu mbi, a son ringawo ran su tsro dindi, nga nji ri riwa a ran su tsro dindi ran ye riyi ngawen. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Inde bi no nji riwa a su tsro dindi ri bubu son riwa a bi,&lt;&lt;Ingye bubu son dindi een&gt;&gt; Ama bi ri tre ri nji ri yaa ri, &lt;&lt;Son ri mu&gt;&gt;Ka bi tre riwu ri, &lt;&lt;Kuson ri meme kusan kpɨre won&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Ashe bi ran ya njo mba tinkan bi ri he wa bla tre rimi meme ri mɨrembi nye mbana?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Sren ton biyi miri vayi won wawa me nyɨme yi: ashe, bi ran to ri Izhi chu wa yaa ri mgbumgblu me nyi no wa he ri wo rimi kpayɨme ran no wa fe gado rimi kpanchi riwa a ka tre dzi ri wawa wa kpa nyɨme ri wu ran? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Ama bi ti meme ti ri wa yaa. Ashe a ran he wawa wa he ri wo nye wa noyi yaa ran? Aran he wawa nye wa gbi yi ri hi bubu bla tre ran? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Ngha a ran he wawa nye wawa wa kpa nde dindi nye riwa wa no yi-a ri time ran? <verse eid="JAS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Inde bi hu kya riwa mbe tre ri,&lt;&lt;Nyɨme nji ri kusan wen bibi riwa wu nyɨme ngawen.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Ama inde bi tsro kankankan ri ngambi, ka bi ti meme ti, ibla tre ri vu yi ritu bi wo. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Inji riwa ari hu tre wawu, ama a kpa riri tɨme, a kpa tre wawu time nye mba. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Ritu wawu riwa a tre ri,&lt;&lt;Ran kru ri wa nji ran,&gt;&gt; Wawu nye tre ri, &lt;&lt;Ran wu nji ran&gt;&gt; To, inde wu ran wa wanjo ran, ama wu wuu nji, rimba wu kpa tre wurusi rega nye mba. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Tre bi ri ti bibi wa nji wawa wa bla tre ri wa ri doka riwa ari kpata chuwo. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Izhi ran losron ri vi riwa ari bla tre ran, a ran ran to losron ran. Ama ilosron ri su bla tre. Ikpanyɨme riwa a ran kabru ri ndu ran a he kuklu.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosron Ngha Ndu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Biyi miri vayi won , bi wan he ngye riwa nji rɨe ri kpanyɨme, ama a ran hu ri ndu riwa ari tsro kpanyɨme ran? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Bibi wan, ka vayi wen vren ron ran he ri tsro ran nga a ran he kya riwa ari ri ran. <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />Bi ngye ri he bubu wan riwa wu tre ri wa ri, &lt;&lt;No Izhi ngɨzhi Yi zhuu ri si kpa! ran no yi kya riwa bi ri nga kya riwa bi so, ri kya riwa bi suu,&gt;&gt; Ama bi ran no wa kya riwa ari dzon wa rimi son mba ran, bi wan ri he kutan? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Nghamba me a he, ikpanyɨme riwa wuran tsro-u ri ndu ran, a he ka kuu. <verse eid="JAS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Ama nji ri tre ri, &lt;&lt;Inji ri he ri kpanyɨme; nga nji ri he ri ndu.&gt;&gt; Itre won he ri, tsro wen kpanyɨme wen riwa ndu ran he rimi wan ran, ama me tsro-u kya riwa ikpanyɨme won ri ti. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Bi kpanyɨme ri Izhi he, A bi! ko wa bɨzhi wa to ngamba, wari ri wirikpa. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />A wu nkpran nji, wu wa no wa tsro-u wa ri ko wu ri to iri ikpanyɨme riwa ndu ran he rimi wan ran a he kuklu? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Riwa A ti wa Timbu Ibrahi a ka vren wan Ishaku de ritu kpanchi ri sro yii, ashe, a ran he ritu yo sron nye a ti ndu mba ran? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Bi ran to ri ikpanyɨme nga ndu wan kabru nye, nga yo sron wan a he ri showa ritu kya riwa a ti. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Ngha tre riwa a he rimi mbe Izhi-a ka tsra riwa a tre ri, &lt;&lt;Ibrahi a kpanyɨme ri Izhi nga kpanyɨme wan nyi a no wa yo-u ri Inji ri dindi.&gt;&gt;Wari yo-u ri ikpan Izhi. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Ashe Izhi ri kpanji chuwo ritu ndu wan riwa ari ti, a ran he ritu kpanyɨme ri kankshe ran. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Aran he ritu ndu riwa Raaba ntran wa a ti nye ran fe kpa chuwo ran? <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />A he bibi riwa inde iviri ran he ri kpa ran, ikpa ri he kuklu; ngamba nye ari he inde ikpanyɨme riwa a ran kabru ran ari he kuklu.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Ti Rereri Nyu wen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Imiri vayi, no kigbu mbi wari no wa ran he wa tsro ran nee, ritu ibla tre mbu wa tsro wau rinchirinchi. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Ikya riwa a he rimi wan, wawumbu ki yɨbasi ri nkon wari kigbu. Inde nji ran ri yɨbasi rimi tre wan ran, a he nji riwa a ti tsra, ari kpa kpawan wawu chuwo. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Inde ki ban ntan ki son ŋɨma ri nyu ari nyɨme ran ti kya riwa ki yo no ti, ari hi bubu riwa ki wa no hi. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Ya nvu ima riwa a he kpankpanfi, ama gungu ri senkpa ri truu nga wato kɨma-u ri vi krefi riwa a he tsawen gyen. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Nghamba nye irɨme he, kpunji a he fiwen gyen rimi kpa ama ari kpon ngawan! nga bi ri ya vi klawulu riwa a he krenkyen wen ama ari gon nchon ji riwa a ban kpata. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Irɨme ngawen he wulu! wawu nye he vi kya riwa a he fiwen rimi wa gbrekpa mbu, wawu nye ri yo kpa mbu ri ti meme ti, ari kpa kpa wawu time, ari gyuru sron ka ti fu, kuma wawu iko wulu nye ri gyuru wu. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Wa nɨma kankankan, wa chenchen, wawa wa gban ri mme, wawa wa he rimi ima nji ri to ngɨzhi wa, ama irɨme han gbengbren nji. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Injo ran he riwa ari to ti ri rɨme ran. Irɨme he kya riwa a ran ri son viri ri meme ti ran, a he ka ntson riwa ari wuu nji. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Ri rɨme nye ki gbre Bachi mbu nga Timbu, nga wawu nye ki lanyu wawa wa ti wa bibi riwa Izhi he. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Rimi nyu-a nye riwa igibreri zhuu nga lanyu. imiri vayi won, no ran he nganyi ran. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Iima riwa a ro so nga ima riwa a ti ima wato zhuu ri bubu riri? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Imiri vayi, konkron mbwa ri to klo wɨlo ngho? ka konkron riwa ari klo wɨlo ri raro rito klo mbwa? ngamba me, wa ran fe ima riwa a ro ri si ima riwa a ti ima ran.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bibi Wiwiri Hari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Nghan rimi mbi riwa a wiri ran ri to ti? No tsro-u ri ra rimi dindi son wan, rimi ti ndu wan no katu riwa wiwiri ri ngɨzhi ye yo ri meme. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Ama inde bi ti huu nga sutu rimi sron mbi, ran kpo ngambi ri kpunji ran. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Ritu bibi &lt;&lt;Wiwiri&gt;&gt;mba ran zhuu shu ye me ran ama a he wiwiri ri meme nye, a ran riwa Yuu Izhi ran, a he riwa meme nji. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Bubu riwa iti huu nga sutu he, ri bubu wan wana fe son ri si kpa ran nga wa ran ti meme ti ri ko bibitan ri bubu wan. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Ama wiwiri riwa a zhuu ri shu ye mme ri gbuchi wan a he Tsitsri nye, ari ngɨzhi son ri si sron ri nyɨme ye, ari kpanji ri wo hari, ari ka ngawan no nji lo sron ri nji, a he nji ri kpunji tre, nga a ran ri sutu ran. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Ari ngɨzhi son ri sikpa ye nga a he nji riwa a chu rimi sikpa wawa wa ngɨzhi sren ritu dindi ti ye.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Ka Nghambi no Izhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Ngye ri ngɨzhi fu nga wanyu ye ri tsutsu mbi? Aran he ritu mbiye riwa bi taku ri sron mbi ran? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />bi ye bi ka wa kya, bi ran fe ran, bi wa nyu bi ri wuu ngambi, bi ti mbiye bi ran fe ran ritu riwa bi ran bre Izhi ran. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Ngha ka bi bre, bi ran fe ran, ritu riwa bi ran ri bre ri sron riri ran, riwa bi wuu rinkon riwa bi ri wuu. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Biyi wa ri kpi nji, bi ran to ritu kpan ri gbungblu a he kawen ri Izhi ran? Ko ngan riwa a chu riwa wu ti kpan ri mgbumgblume ari he kpan fu Izhi. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Ka bi to itre riwa a tre ri mbe wan a he kuklu, a tre ri&lt;&lt;Iyu nyi riwa Izhi kau yo rimi mbu ri gben ta a ran he tsawen ran.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Izhi nye ri no ta dindi ti. Wawu nye riwa itre Izhi tre ri, &lt;&lt;Izhi ri kawan ri wawa wa ban ngamba ri wawa han ko ngan, ama ari no wawa wa ka tu mba yo ri nme.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Ka ngambi no Izhi, kri gbengben ri meme nji, ari klu yi. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Ye kusan Izhi wawu ngawen ri ye kusan wen. Ngla wo mbi biyi wawa bi ti meme ti, nga bi ri Tsri sron ngambi, biyi wawa bi he ri sron hari. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Yii ri ti shnji sron, bi ri taka. Sran nza mbi no he yii, nga no kinklan sron mbi no he kpa sron time. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Ka sron mbi yo rɨme ri Bachi, wawu ri nzu yi dzi nde.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Biyi miri vayi won, ran wa ngambi ri tre ran. Inde ko ngan wa vayi wan ri tre ka a no vayi wan lefi. Inji riwa a wa vayi wan ri tre, a wa bla tre nyu, wu ran ri hu wa tre-a ran. Inde wu no nji lefi ka wuran ri hu doka Izhi ran ama wu bla ri wu. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Inji riwa ari de doka he riri, wawunye ri ti-u, wawu nye he ri gbengbren ri kpau chuwo ran he ri gbengbren ri wuu. Ko a wu wu he ngan riwa wu no vayi wen lefi?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ran kpongawen Ritu Mi bre ran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Wawa wa tre ri,&lt;&lt;Luwa ka mi bre ki hi ri bubu nmu ki ri ti se ri ki ri sondu reri kpi kiri ri riba ki sro ngan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Kugon riwa bi ran to kya riwa mibreri ngɨzhi ye ran. Isron mbi he bibi tan? Isron mbi he ka iwulu nye riwa ari chichi kado. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Tsede a he riwa wu tre ri, &lt;&lt;Inde Bachi kpanyɨme ran ngɨzhi ta hi zhuu, ki ti nganyi ki ri ti ngamu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Ama bi sondu ri kpongambi ri kuklu, bibi kpo ngambi he ri kuklu nye. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Ritu ngamba, nji riwa a to kya riwa a bi no ti-u, ran ka wan ri ti-u a ti meme ti nye mba.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Ifen Ton Ritu Wawa wa he ri Woo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Wawa wa he ri woo wa he me? Sondu ran yii ri kpagro ritu shnji sron mbi kan-kan-kan riwa wa ye ri yi. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Iwo mbi wa gla tɨme, nga wa ran wa ri wa tsro mbi. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Wa zinariya mbi nga azurfa wa time kre, itime mba nyi wa to-u ritu mbi, ari ri nɨma kpa mbi ka iwulu! Bi vu wa wo mbi kpan ri nzan ri krenkpen nyi! <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Ngye ngan, ise riwa bi ti ri wawa wa sren ri zhu mbi ri sondu ri sronghan, iyi wawa wa sren zhu ri ton Bachi riwa gbugbu nji. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Ison mbi ri mgbumgblu me nyi a he ri raro ri son ritu mbi, bi ho ngambi bi ri wuloga ka nghima riwa wa ka dzi riwa wa han-u to. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Bi no nji wa dindi ti yaa, bi ri wuu wa ama wa ran tre kya ran.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ivu Sron Rimi Yaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Ritu ngamba, vu sron yi miri vayi won, hi chachu riwa Bachi ri ye, to bibi riwa nji ri ron ri gben zhu wan riwa ari fe kpi rimi wan bran, ari vu sron ri fe wan, no wulu ri suu nga wulu ri ga. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Biyi ngawen vu sron ri ngambi, bi ri kuki ri sron mbi, ritu ivi ri ye Bachi ran he kpata ngaran. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Imiri vayi ran ti zhuzhu ri ngambi ran, ritu no wa ran no yi yaa ran. Ingye nji ri bla tre ri nkon tra mba! <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Ritu bibi so yaa ri vu sron, miri vayi, ya wawa wa ti Izhi ngawen wawa wa tre ri nde Bachi. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Ki ye kika gbre wawa wa vu sron. Bi to bibi vu sron riwa Ayuba a ti, bi ri to bibi kre wan ikya riwa Bachi a ti riwu, bibi riwa Bachi he nji riwa ari to lo sron ran to yaa nji. <verse eid="JAS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Ihan kongye, &lt;&lt; Miri vayi, ran shizhii ran, ko ri shu ko ri meme ko ri bibi shizhii bibi tan. Tsede ka bi tre ri,&lt;&lt;Een&gt;&gt;Ka kri ri&lt;&lt;Een&gt;&gt; Inde bi tre ri &lt;&lt;onhon&gt;&gt;Ritu no Izhi no ran ka no yi yaa ran.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibre Ri Yo Sron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Inde iri mbi ri so yaa, no bre, inde iri mbi ri ti kinklan sron, no chuse ri gbre Izhi. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Inde iri mbi ri lo lilo, no yo wa rinkon ri tra Izhi no wa bre Izhi ri wu, wa ri ran gban nye ri wu ri nde Bachi. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Ibre ri kpanyɨme ri kpa wa lilo chuwo; Bachi ri bru ngɨzhi si ye ri wu bibi riwa a ran he. Inde a ti meme ti, Izhi ri ka meme ti wan rega ri wu. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Ritu ngamba, la ngambi meme ti mbi bi ri bre Izhi ri ngambi bi ri fe si. IibreIzhi riwa nji ri Tsitsri a senkpa ran ri ti ndu mgbazhi ran. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Iliya a he nji ka kita me. A bre Izhi iri no wulu no ran ye ran, iwulu-a ka kukri ti se tra ri hwa tanren. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Riwa a bru bre Izhi, ishu wulu ka de wulu, meme ka de ri rimi wan. <verse eid="JAS 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Imiri vayi won, inde iri rimi mbi yɨba si rimi kpunji tre, bi ka ngɨzhi-u ye ri nkon. <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />Taka rinyi: Ko ngan riwa a ngɨzhi nji riwa a yɨba si ye ri nkon ari kpa chuwo ri nkon kuu, ran ka kpa meme ti wan riwa a ti.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>